Found it. In `vitest.config.ts`, the browser project sets:

```ts
deps: {
  optimizer: {
    web: {
      enabled: true,
      exclude: ["@sentry/react"],
    },
  },
},
```

That `web` key is dead. I checked Vitest 4.1.10's actual runtime (not just the (loosely-typed) config types) in `node_modules/vitest/dist/chunks/coverage.DM_a_rWm.js`:

```js
resolved.deps.optimizer.client ??= {};
resolved.deps.optimizer.client.enabled ??= false;
